#. そもそも、不二咲千尋は…
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"First of all, we know\n"
"where Chihiro was headed..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>トレーニングに行こう<CLT>と
#. していたはずよ。
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "He was on his way to go <CLT 9>exercise<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そこで、彼はどうして…
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So next we have to ask..."
msgstr ""

#. あんなジャージを選んだのかしらね？
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Why did he choose\n"
"the specific tracksuit that he did?"
msgstr ""

#. あんなジャージとは
#. どういう意味だ？
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"What do you mean,\n"
"the specific tracksuit?"
msgstr ""

#. わかったぞ。
#. 彼が選んだジャージは…
msgctxt "0006 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"I got it!\n"
"He picked that tracksuit because..."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人が持っている物と
#. お揃いだったのだな！
msgctxt "0007 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "...it matched the one the culprit was wearing!"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、犯人は…
msgctxt "0008 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "So what you're saying is..."
msgstr ""

#. アイツと同じ<CLT 9>青いジャージ<CLT>を
#. 持ってんだな？
msgctxt "0009 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"The killer was wearing\n"
"the same <CLT 9>blue tracksuit<CLT> as him?"
msgstr ""

#. オレのは<CLT 9>黒いジャージ<CLT>だ！
msgctxt "0010 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "<CLT 9>My tracksuit is black<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. ぼ、僕はジャージすら
#. 持ってないですぞ…
msgctxt "0011 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "I-I don't even have a tracksuit..."
msgstr ""

#. だって、運動って嫌いだモン！
msgctxt "0012 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Cuz exercising sucks!"
msgstr ""

#. 俺は<CLT 9>白いジャージ<CLT>を
#. 持ってんぞ。
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I have a <CLT 9>white tracksuit<CLT>, personally."
msgstr ""

#. 寄宿舎倉庫から持ってきたんだ！
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I got it from the warehouse,\n"
"if you must know!"
msgstr ""

#. 本当に、こんな話で
#. 犯人がわかるのですか？
msgctxt "0015 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Did any of that really help us\n"
"get any closer to figuring out\n"
"who the culprit is...?"
msgstr ""

#. いや…無理だろ…
msgctxt "0016 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "No way... Not a chance..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>私は基本着てるし…<CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>I pretty much always wear one...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>私も同じ理由です。<CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>I'm the same way!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>何これ？　ジャージ自慢？<CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>What, are you all trying to brag?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>まあ、それはいいんだけど…<CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>That's all well and good, but...<CLT>"
msgstr ""
